    <h2 class="ai-model-section">MTIA 450</h2>
    <p>The 400 turned into the 450, tuned for GenAI inference. Meta's 11 March 2026 news post says the 450 and 500 are optimized first for GenAI inference. Mass deployment of the 450 is scheduled for early 2027.</p>
