    <h2 class="ai-model-section">MTIA 500</h2>
    <p>The 450 advanced into the 500 for GenAI inference. Mass deployment is scheduled for 2027. The 500 arranges smaller compute chiplets in a 2 by 2 configuration, plus two network chiplets.</p>
